PTX CoWR+surface+fence.proxy
"Write then two reads of one location through the surface proxy, in one thread, with a surface proxy fence between the reads. SC per location (8.10.2) makes both reads see the write."
{
x = 0;
s @ surface aliases x;
P0:r0=0;
P0:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0       ;
 sust.weak s, 1       ;
 suld.weak r0, s      ;
 fence.proxy.surface  ;
 suld.weak r1, s      ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 \/ P0:r1 == 0)
